This Android library is ReadOS-authored glue around the adjacent
`native/msp-command-runtime-ffi` C ABI. It contains a real Android Gradle
library, Kotlin API, JNI C++ shim, and packaging integration for the Rust
`aarch64-linux-android` shared object. It does not contain raw MSP source.

The adjacent native crate and this Android module are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE-APACHE-2.0 for the complete license.

The release module is intentionally arm64-v8a-only at this stage. An
x86_64 emulator instrumentation fixture now runs in the portable workflow.
Arm64 device/emulator execution remains a separate backend gate; Gradle
compile/AAR packaging and JNI/Rust ABI checks are also real build gates.
